 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","安全日报 · 2026-11-22","generatedAt","2026-11-22T00:00:44.006Z","lead",{"_52":115,"_208":202},"leadItemId","jbitkvf4i6iewvak8ejgx9cvb","overview","highlights",[205,206,207],"sections",[169,170,171],"flashes",[149],"cover",{"_142":143,"_144":145,"_146":-5,"_147":-5,"_148":-5},"metrics",{"_137":51,"_138":47,"_139":140,"_141":140},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/e5ce33c8ccd18ae8.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/667dd44b5de9ceeb.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/386feffa98e44691.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/e5ce33c8ccd18ae8.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_150":151,"_52":152,"_153":154,"_155":156,"_157":158,"_159":160,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168},"itemId","iepvrh0cnji8gnmctayok0ho0","Rackspace Spot 云平台遭入侵，攻击者读取客户 Kubernetes Secrets","summary","攻击者使用泄露凭据入侵 Rackspace Spot 云平台，在部分客户组织中以合法用户身份创建 Kubernetes Pod、读取 Secrets，并列出节点和卷，受害凭据可能包括密码、认证令牌、API 密钥及 Spot API 令牌。","sourceName","BleepingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/rackspace-spot-breach-let-hackers-access-customer-kubernetes-secrets/","publishedAt","2026-11-21T22:59:58.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,{"_172":199,"_153":-5,"_174":200},{"_172":185,"_153":-5,"_174":186},{"_172":173,"_153":-5,"_174":175},"label","研究与披露","items",[176],{"_150":177,"_52":178,"_153":179,"_155":180,"_157":181,"_159":182,"_161":183,"_163":184,"_165":166,"_167":168},"dfh23lubzfof7rir61cxf0nq4","NebuSec 演示恶意网页劫持 Meta Muse 并读取私人聊天与记忆","NebuSec 演示恶意网页可绕过审批提示，从 Meta Muse 云端机器提取并篡改用户聊天记录与存储记忆，并结合内置浏览器和 Linux 内核缺陷取得机器控制权，访问凭据存储、保存文件及 Sentinel。攻击仅影响单台云端机器，未进入共享服务器或其他用户设备；研究为实验室演示，NebuSec 称所披露弱点均已修复，但 Meta 尚未公开确认，补丁发布前是否有用户数据被访问也未说明。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/a-single-malicious-webpage-let.html","2026-11-21T11:53:07.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","攻击与威胁",[187,188],{"_150":194,"_52":195,"_153":196,"_155":156,"_157":197,"_159":198,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168},{"_150":189,"_52":190,"_153":191,"_155":156,"_157":192,"_159":193,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168},"dbml5ujd9k2y3agezdbxfdnmx","BADBOX 3.0 botnet 回归，每日发起 40 亿次欺诈广告竞价请求","HUMAN 的 Satori 研究人员发现 BADBOX 3.0 通过受感染的 Android 设备每日发起约 40 billion 次欺诈广告竞价请求，峰值占其观察到的 CTV 流量的 4% 以上。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/badbox-30-botnet-returns-with-record-breaking-40-billion-daily-ad-requests/","2026-11-21T15:17:27.000Z","lwn1awdsmrazlhsmt4r21vq0w","Microsoft Entra Connect Health 漏洞遭利用，租户数据被未授权访问","攻击者利用 Microsoft Entra Connect Health API 漏洞，未授权读取租户级元数据，并可能修改 Connect Health 监控配置。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/microsoft-entra-connect-health-flaw-exploited-to-steal-tenant-data/","2026-11-21T18:01:58.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[201],{"_150":122,"_52":115,"_153":202,"_155":180,"_157":203,"_159":204,"_161":183,"_163":184,"_165":166,"_167":168},"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 的 4 个漏洞列入 KEV，依据是已发现活跃利用证据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-critical-vmware-cisco.html","2026-11-21T08:49:13.000Z",{"_150":194,"_52":195,"_153":196,"_155":156,"_157":197,"_159":198,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168},{"_150":189,"_52":190,"_153":191,"_155":156,"_157":192,"_159":193,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168},{"_150":177,"_52":178,"_153":179,"_155":180,"_157":181,"_159":182,"_161":183,"_163":184,"_165":166,"_167":168},"leadParagraph",{"_210":211,"_212":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
